# Interim work-in-progress snapshots. These are delivered directly to the user for
# progress inspection and are deliberately NOT auditable: they carry repaired source
# alongside not-yet-regenerated evidence, so their own integrity tests fail by
# design. Keeping them out of history stops an auditor who clones this branch from
# finding a bundle that looks like a delivery but is not one. Only the numbered
# LINEAGE_M1_IMPLEMENTATION_AUDIT_BUNDLE_REV*.zip artifacts are committed.
*_WORK_IN_PROGRESS_NOT_FOR_AUDIT.zip
